==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Everyone's Exciting Battle|Marill|11}} from the {{TCG|Everyone's Exciting Battle}} collection, which was only released in Japan.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Marill|76}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*{{m|Tackle}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Marill}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

